-- words --
In a copy of hyp's own log, `hyp status` prints the same state line for each of its 17 Goals as it prints today.
-- run --
hyp status | grep -E '^G-'
-- floor: contains --
G-9XX4KB  ended  runs: 1 of 3 used
-- floor: contains --
G-SBFXAY  ended  runs: 1 of 3 used
-- floor: contains --
G-G4NNT7  ended  runs: 0 of 3 used
-- floor: contains --
G-GF11ED  ended  runs: 1 of 3 used
